{"unit_id":"wbb316__dsh-profile-sync#card-zh","repo":"wbb316/dsh-profile-sync","commit":"dc2c6a01931ff87cd100cd842dfe241c9e38550c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-profile-sync（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在不同 DSH profile 之间比较并迁移已安装的插件，常用于把网页版 web 的插件配置带到桌面版 desktop。它向 DSH 注册 profile_sync 工具，并提供侧边栏迁移面板接口。用户可以先查看差异和阻断项，再选择插件应用，或生成退出后运行的脚本；迁移后可在重启时核对依赖和 bundle 是否实际生效，也能查看本机 profile。目标为当前 profile 时通过应用内官方管理器处理，其他目标使用离线脚本。插件不声明额外配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:230-410","lib/index.js:663-731"]}
{"unit_id":"wbb316__dsh-profile-sync#card-en","repo":"wbb316/dsh-profile-sync","commit":"dc2c6a01931ff87cd100cd842dfe241c9e38550c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-profile-sync compares and migrates plugins between DSH profiles. Its profile_sync tool previews differences, applies selected plugins through the official manager, or writes an offline script for another profile. After restart it checks dependencies and bundles.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:230-410","lib/index.js:663-731"]}
